@@ -3,3 +3,20 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module (`src/index.ts`)
+
+`createRentalService()` returns an in-memory service: `addEquipment`, `quote`, `book`.
+
+School rules that apply to everything the module does:
+
+1. Money is an integer number of euro cents.
+2. Times are in UTC, written as ISO-8601 strings (an explicit `Z` / `+00:00` is required).
+3. A booking covers whole days only: a period starts and ends at midnight UTC, and it ends at the start
+   of the day after its last day (periods are half-open, so back-to-back bookings do not overlap).
+4. The same item cannot be booked twice for overlapping periods.
+5. Cancellation policy: a booking cancelled less than 24 hours before its start gets no refund;
+   otherwise the full amount is refunded. **Not implemented yet** (no cancellation exists); bookings
+   keep their `total` and `start` so the refund can be computed when it is added.
+
+Tests: `npm test` (Node 22+, runs the TypeScript directly).
